      "label": "Average number of hours (actually) worked per week for employed persons aged 15-74 (LFS) by degree of attachment to the labour market, sex and age. Year 2005-2025",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2026-01-23T07:00:00Z",
      "link": {
